@startuml
actor Dreamer
participant "System" as System
database Storage

Dreamer -> System: Submit dream with consent and privacy settings
System -> Storage: Create session and save dream
System --> Dreamer: Display 5-7 follow-up questions
Dreamer -> System: Submit and edit answers
System -> Storage: Save answers to session
System -> Storage: Generate and save Freudian analysis report
System --> Dreamer: Display full analysis report
Dreamer -> System: Request past sessions list
System -> Storage: Retrieve sessions metadata
System --> Dreamer: Display sessions list and filters
@enduml